You could say {mi klama seka'a la lyndn teka'a la paris veka'a lo pluta
xeka'a lo sorprekarce}, but I don't think that's what you wanted.

{mi kalma pa'o lo pluta to'o la lyndn fa'a la paris sepi'o lo sorprekarce}
is what you want; bearing in mind that the TAG SUMTI constructs can be
rearranged in any way with respect to each other, and that {pa'o} means
something rather different than the 4th place of {klama}.

